## netlab-corpus v1
## id: c14-script-mode-restore
## kind: router
## provenance: authored
## note: script from a config-if seat — script navigates its own modes,
## note: arms a pending dialog on the last line, ends mid-dialog; the seat
## note: (node, ctx, pending=none) restores to the caller's config-if.

enable
conf t
interface g0/0

## script
interface g0/1
description nested
reload
no
## endscript

show ip interface brief
end
